---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const schema = [
 {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  "name": "About Word Hunt Solver",
  "url": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/about",
  "about": {
   "@id": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/#organization"
  },
  "inLanguage": "en-US"
 },
 {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
   {
    "@type": "ListItem",
    "position": 1,
    "name": "Home",
    "item": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/"
   },
   {
    "@type": "ListItem",
    "position": 2,
    "name": "About",
    "item": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/about"
   }
  ]
 }
];
---

<Layout
  title="About Word Hunt Solver"
  description="Who runs Word Hunt Solver, how we keep our Word Hunt facts accurate, and how to reach us. An independent site, not connected to GamePigeon."
  path="/about"
  schema={schema}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-14 pt-6 sm:px-6 sm:pt-10">
    <header id="top" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-sm text-brand-400 dark:text-brand-300"><a href="/" class="hover:text-headline">Home</a> / <span aria-current="page">About</span></nav>
<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-[1.15] text-headline dark:text-headline-dark sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem]">About Word Hunt Solver</h1>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">This is a free website that helps GamePigeon Word Hunt players find every word on a board, see how to swipe it, and learn from the words they missed.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="max-w-4xl py-6 sm:py-8">
<section id="what-youll-find-here" class="mt-10 scroll-mt-24 first:mt-0">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">What You'll Find Here</h2>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Word Hunt Solver has two free tools and a set of guides. Our <a href="/" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">free solver</a> finds every word on a board you type in or upload as a screenshot, on boards from 3x3 up to 6x6. It shows the points for each word and the exact path to swipe it. Our <a href="/evolver" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">Board Evolver</a> builds high scoring practice boards, so you can train on boards packed with long words.</p>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"><a href="/guides" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">Our guides</a> go deeper on single topics: how to win more rounds, when using a solver is fair, and which word tool fits which kind of puzzle.</p>
</section>
<section id="what-we-cover" class="mt-10 scroll-mt-24 first:mt-0">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">What We Cover</h2>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We focus only on GamePigeon Word Hunt, the word game played inside iMessage. Every tool and guide here is built for that one game, so the advice fits the way Word Hunt actually plays and scores. We don't cover other word games, apps, or puzzles, except to explain how they differ from Word Hunt.</p>
</section>
<section id="our-standards-for-accuracy" class="mt-10 scroll-mt-24 first:mt-0">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Our Standards for Accuracy</h2>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We check game facts against GamePigeon's App Store listing and against the documentation for the ENABLE word list, which is the word list our solver uses. We say which word list we use on every page where it matters.</p>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">When a detail about the game hasn't been confirmed, like how points work for words longer than 8 letters, we leave it out or say plainly that it's unconfirmed instead of guessing. If you spot a mistake, tell us and we'll check it.</p>
</section>
<section id="independent-from-gamepigeon" class="mt-10 scroll-mt-24 first:mt-0">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Independent From GamePigeon</h2>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We're an independent site. We have no connection to GamePigeon or Apple, and we don't speak for either one. GamePigeon and its game names belong to their owners.</p>
</section>
<section id="your-privacy" class="mt-10 scroll-mt-24 first:mt-0">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Your Privacy</h2>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Both tools run in your browser. The letters you type and any screenshot you upload stay on your device and are never sent to our server. You don't need an account to use any tool on this site. Read our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">privacy policy</a> for the full details, including how we use analytics cookies.</p>
</section>
<section id="contact-us" class="mt-10 scroll-mt-24 first:mt-0">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-white">Contact Us</h2>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Found a bug, a word the solver missed, or a wrong fact? Reach us through our <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">contact page</a>, and we'll get back to you.</p>
</section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
